ackground: var(--wp--preset--gradient--cool-to-warm-spectrum) !important;}.has-blush-light-purple-gradient-background{background: var(--wp--preset--gradient--blush-light-purple) !important;}.has-blush-bordeaux-gradient-background{background: var(--wp--preset--gradient--blush-bordeaux) !important;}.has-luminous-dusk-gradient-background{background: var(--wp--preset--gradient--luminous-dusk) !important;}.has-pale-ocean-gradient-background{background: var(--wp--preset--gradient--pale-ocean) !important;}.has-electric-grass-gradient-background{background: var(--wp--preset--gradient--electric-grass) !important;}.has-midnight-gradient-background{background: var(--wp--preset--gradient--midnight) !important;}.has-small-font-size{font-size: var(--wp--preset--font-size--small) !important;}.has-medium-font-size{font-size: var(--wp--preset--font-size--medium) !important;}.has-large-font-size{font-size: var(--wp--preset--font-size--large) !important;}.has-x-large-font-size{font-size: var(--wp--preset--font-size--x-large) !important;}\n/*# sourceURL=global-styles-inline-css */\n</style>\n\n<!--[if lte IE 9]>\r\n<style type=\"text/css\" media=\"screen\">\r\n\t#page, \r\n\t#footer, \r\n\t.menu li,\r\n  a.button,\r\n  .user-menu li,\r\n  .user-menu li:hover\t{\r\n\t\tbehavior: url(https://openhardwaremonitor.org/wordpress/wp-content/themes/openhardwaremonitor/pie.htc);\r\n\t}\r\n</style>\r\n<![endif]-->\r\n<link rel=\"https://api.w.org/\" href=\"https://openhardwaremonitor.org/wp-json/\" /><link rel=\"alternate\" title=\"JSON\" type=\"application/json\" href=\"https://openhardwaremonitor.org/wp-json/wp/v2/pages/8\" /><link rel=\"EditURI\" type=\"application/rsd+xml\" title=\"RSD\" href=\"https://openhardwaremonitor.org/wordpress/xmlrpc.php?rsd\" />\n<meta name=\"generator\" content=\"WordPress 7.1.4\" />\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://openhardwaremonitor.org/downloads/\" />\n<link rel='shortlink' href='https://openhardwaremonitor.org/?p=8' />\n</head>\r\n\r\n<body>\r\n\r\n<div id=\"page\">\r\n<div id=\"header\">\r\n<div id=\"user-menu-container\">\r\n<ul class=\"user-menu\">\r\n<li class=\"left\"><a href=\"https://openhardwaremonitor.org/wordpress/wp-login.php\">Login</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"logo\">\r\n<a href=\"https://openhardwaremonitor.org\">\r\n<img src=\"https://openhardwaremonitor.org/wordpress/wp-content/themes/openhardwaremonitor/images/logo.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" alt=\"Logo\"/>\r\n<img src=\"https://openhardwaremonitor.org/wordpress/wp-content/themes/openhardwaremonitor/images/title.png\" width=\"306\" height=\"48\" alt=\"Open Hardware Monitor\"/>\r\n</a>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"menu-main-menu-container\"><ul id=\"menu-main-menu\" class=\"menu\"><li id=\"menu-item-116\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-custom menu-item-object-custom menu-item-home menu-item-116\"><a href=\"http://openhardwaremonitor.org/\">Home</a></li>\n<li id=\"menu-item-20\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page current-menu-item page_item page-item-8 current_page_item menu-item-20\"><a href=\"https://openhardwaremonitor.org/downloads/\" aria-current=\"page\">Downloads</a></li>\n<li id=\"menu-item-106\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-106\"><a href=\"https://openhardwaremonitor.org/screenshots/\">Screenshots</a></li>\n<li id=\"menu-item-115\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-115\"><a href=\"https://openhardwaremonitor.org/documentation/\">Documentation</a></li>\n<li id=\"menu-item-114\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-114\"><a href=\"https://openhardwaremonitor.org/support/\">Support</a></li>\n<li id=\"menu-item-113\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-113\"><a href=\"https://openhardwaremonitor.org/license/\">License</a></li>\n</ul></div></div>\r\n\r\n<div id=\"content\">\r\n\r\n\r\n<div id=\"main\">\r\n<div id=\"main-inner\">\r\n\r\n\r\n<h1>Downloads</h1>\r\n<div class=\"entry\"><p>The free Open Hardware Monitor software runs on Microsoft Windows with the .NET Framework version 4.5 and above. On Linux systems the Open Hardware Monitor requires Mono with WinForms.</p>\r\n<p><a class=\"download-button\" style=\"color: #333333; text-decoration: none;\" href=\"https://openhardwaremonitor.org/files/openhardwaremonitor-v0.9.6.zip\"><br /><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold;\">Download Now</span><br /><span style=\"font-size: 11px;\">Open Hardware Monitor 0.9.6</span><br /></a></p>\r\n<h2>Installation</h2>\r\n<p>To install just unpack the zip archive and run OpenHardwareMonitor.exe with Administrator rights. Without Administrator rights most hardware sensors are not accessible. The application is still in Beta status, so use it at your own risk.</p>\r\n<div style=\"position: absolute; left: -6001px; width: 991px;\">\r\n                                                On the Downloads page of Open Hardware Monitor, users look for reliable tools that deliver transparency and control over their systems. Just as open-source software allows you to monitor performance in real time, reliable health solutions provide clarity in personal well-being. For example, resources explaining how to <a href=\"https://www.daoudeyecare.net/favicons/bimatoprost.html\">buy latisse</a> offer guidance on a treatment derived from bimatoprost, widely known for enhancing eyelash growth. Clear information, whether about hardware sensors or medical options, empowers people to make informed choices. In both cases, trust in the source is crucial\u2014software should be safe, and health advice should be accurate. Downloads that improve system stability mirror health resources that improve daily confidence. Just as monitoring prevents overheating in PCs, proper treatments can help prevent issues from escalating in personal care. Open Hardware Monitor demonstrates how transparency builds reliability, a principle that extends beyond technology. With the right tools and knowledge, users can optimize both their systems and their lives.\r\n                                            </div>\r\n<h2>Source Code</h2>\r\n<p>The source code of the Open Hardware Monitor is hosted at <a href=\"https://github.com/openhardwaremonitor\">https://github.com/openhardwaremonitor</a>.</p>\r\n<p>You can clone the repository from the HTTPS clone URL:</p>\r\n<div class=\"code\">https://github.com/openhardwaremonitor/openhardwaremonitor.git</div>\r\n<p>You can browse or download a zip file of the Open Hardware Monitor source code at the repository page <a href=\"https://github.com/openhardwaremonitor/openhardwaremonitor\">https://github.com/openhardwaremonitor/openhardwaremonitor</a>.</p>\r\n<h2>Previous Versions</h2>\r\n<p>Previous versions of the Open Hardware Monitor:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://openhardwaremonitor.org/files/openhardwaremonitor-v0.9.5.zip\">Open Hardware Monitor 0.9.5</a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://openhardwaremonitor.org/files/openhardwaremonitor-v0.9.4.zip\">Open Hardware Monitor 0.9.4</a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://openhardwaremonitor.org/files/openhardwaremonitor-v0.9.3.zip\">Open Hardware Monitor 0.9.3</a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://openhardwaremonitor.org/files/openhardwaremonitor-v0.9.2.zip\">Open Hardware Monitor 0.9.2</a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://openhardwaremonitor.org/files/openhardwaremonitor-v0.9.1.zip\">Open Hardware Monitor 0.9.1</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n\r\n<div id=\"sidebar-container\">\r\n<div class=\"sidebar\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li id=\"text-7\" class=\"widget widget_text\"><h2 class=\"widgettitle\">Donate</h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"textwidget\"><p>If you like the Open Hardware Monitor, feel free to make a donation.</p>\r\n<div align=\"center\">\r\n<a href=\"https://www.paypal.com/cgi-bin/webscr?cmd=_s-xclick&amp;hosted_button_id=UN92CJU2XY7DY\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img width=\"92\" height=\"26\" src=\"https://openhardwaremonitor.org/wordpress/wp-content/themes/openhardwaremonitor/images/donate.png\" alt=\"Donate\" border=\"0\"/></a></div></div>\n\t\t</li>\n<li id=\"search-4\" class=\"widget widget_search\"><h2 class=\"widgettitle\">Search</h2>\n<form method=\"get\" id=\"searchform\" class=\"searchform\" action=\"https://openhardwaremonitor.org/\">\n\t\t\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<label class=\"screen-reader-text\" for=\"s\">Search for:</label>\n\t\t\t\t\t<input type=\"text\" value=\"\" name=\"s\" id=\"s\" />\n\t\t\t\t\t<input type=\"submit\" id=\"searchsubmit\" value=\"Search\" />\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</form></li>\n<li id=\"archives-4\" class=\"widget widget_archive\"><h2 class=\"widgettitle\">News</h2>\n\n\t\t\t<ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t<li><a href='https://openhardwaremonitor.org/2020/12/'>December 2020</a></li>\n\t<li><a href='https://openhardwaremonitor.org/2020/05/'>May 2020</a></li>\n\t<li><a href='https://openhardwaremonitor.org/2020/03/'>March 2020</a></li>\n\t<li><a href='https://openhardwaremonitor.org/2020/02/'>February 2020</a></li>\n\t<li><a href='https://openhardwaremonitor.org/2016/11/'>November 2016</a></li>\n\t<li><a href='https://openhardwaremonitor.org/2014/12/'>December 2014</a></li>\n\t<li><a href='https://openhardwaremonitor.org/2013/07/'>July 2013</a></li>\n\t<li><a href='https://openhardwaremonitor.org/2012/07/'>July 2012</a></li>\n\t<li><a href='https://openhardwaremonitor.org/2012/01/'>January 2012</a></li>\n\t<li><a href='https://openhardwaremonitor.org/2011/05/'>May 2011</a></li>\n\t<li><a href='https://openhardwaremonitor.org/2011/04/'>April 2011</a></li>\n\t<li><a href='https://openhardwaremonitor.org/2010/10/'>October 2010</a></li>\n\t<li><a href='https://openhardwaremonitor.org/2010/07/'>July 2010</a></li>\n\t<li><a href='https://openhardwaremonitor.org/2010/05/'>May 2010</a></li>\n\t<li><a href='https://openhardwaremonitor.org/2010/04/'>April 2010</a></li>\n\t<li><a href='https://openhardwaremonitor.org/2010/03/'>